OL,3,GNEWSAWheelchair users hit by shortage
OL,4,Aof accessible taxis
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Janice Johnstone wants to go for a
OL,7,Fnight out in Dumfries, it can turn into
OL,8,Fsomething of a military operation.
OL,10,FThere is just one wheelchair-accessible
OL,11,Ftaxi available to take her anywhere, so
OL,12,Fshe has to book him days in advance in
OL,13,Forder to be sure of making any
OL,14,Fappointment.
OL,16,FA last minute plan, which many of us
OL,17,Fmight take for granted, is not
OL,18,Fsomething she can even consider.
OL,20,F"You can't do anything on the spur of
OL,21,Fthe moment - not at all," she said.
